[i]Your basket is overflowing with candy, luckily you’re an expert at balancing and you have no fear of a single piece falling[/i]
[i]The House’s charm rests warmly in your hand, its inhabitants swirling in a rhythmic pattern. [/i]
[i]You’re grateful for all of the help you’ve received and the bonds you forged upon your journey[/i]
MC: (It’s about time I came home.)
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/good-1.png" fade="2.0"]


[i]You find yourself back where it all began, the woods connecting this street to the rest of the town. [/i]
[i]Looking back at the block, you wonder what you’ll tell your friends after this whole escapade[/i]
[i]You have a hopeful thought that your old companions could get along well with your new ones,[/i]
[i]... and perhaps in time, your monster buddies could reintegrate into society.[/i]

[i]That may take a long time though, but it’s a process you’re willing to facilitate[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/good-2.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]You smile and tie the charm around your wrist, stepping into the brush. You feel warm as a soft glow emanates from the bottle. [/i]
[i]The clawlike branches of the trees and shrubbery recede, almost as if they were making way for your path forward[/i]
[i]After a peaceful walk, the light from the bottle blends in with the surrounding light of the main path[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-4.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]A familiar child talks to their parent—One of your friends! You rush over, happy to reunite with them. [/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-5.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]Your friend opens their mouth to scold you, but notices the mountain of candy in your basket[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/ok-5.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]They look at you incredulously before asking where you could’ve gone to get such a bounty. You give a wide smile and tell them that next time you’ll share the secret, with the rest of the friend group too[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/ok-6.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]Your friend rolls their eyes and sarcastically remarks that you can just gatekeep the place if you want.[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/ok-7.png" fade="2.0"]
[i] Both of you agree that it’s getting quite late and that you’ll catch up properly another time, and the two of you part ways[/i]

[i]You find yourself fiddling with the charm on your wrist, [/i]

[background fade="2.0"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/good-3.png" fade="1.0"]
[i]and hope that next Halloween will be another one full of surprises[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/good_end.png"]
